---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Bold Performance"
  description="How Bold Performance handles coaching inquiries, local training tool inputs, hosting, and privacy-focused website analytics."
>
  <section class="section legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">BOLD PERFORMANCE</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated October 12, 2026.</p>
    <h2>When you contact Brock</h2>
    <p>
      Bold Performance uses information you voluntarily share, such as your
      name, email, and training goals, to respond to your inquiry and discuss
      coaching. Please do not send sensitive medical information through this
      website.
    </p>
    <h2>Website services</h2>
    <p>
      Preparing an email introduction happens in your browser and sends nothing
      automatically. When direct delivery is enabled, submissions are processed
      by <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/">Formspree</a>.
      Email, phone, text, and Instagram links open their respective services,
      whose privacy policies apply. This website does not include advertising
      trackers.
    </p>
    <h2>Website analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Vercel Web Analytics measures visits and popular pages using aggregated
      statistics without cookies. It processes technical details such as
      browser, device, approximate location, and referring site. We do not send
      form answers or training tool inputs as analytics events. See
      <a href="https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy">
        Vercel’s analytics privacy documentation
      </a>
      for details about its data handling.
    </p>
    <h2>Training tools and drafts</h2>
    <p>
      Tool inputs and unsent form drafts are held in the current browser page.
      Reloading clears them. Downloaded plans and introductions are saved on
      your device, where you control whether to keep or share them. Tool results
      are not automatically included in a coaching inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and fonts</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted by Vercel and loads its typefaces from Google Fonts.
      Loading the site and its fonts requires requests to those providers. Their
      handling of technical request information is described in their respective
      privacy policies:
      <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">Vercel</a> and
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      To ask about information you have shared, request its deletion, or stop
      further contact, email{" "}
      <a href="mailto:boldperformancellc@gmail.com">
        boldperformancellc@gmail.com
      </a>
      .
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/">
      ← Back to home
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
